---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutImg from '../assets/about-walking.jpg';
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs text-brand-800 mb-4">About</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        A coach who's lived inside the game.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Patrick Pockels has been playing competitive golf for over <strong>20 years</strong> and teaching
          for the last <strong>five</strong>. He's spent that time figuring out what actually moves the
          needle for amateur golfers — and what's just noise.
        </p>
        <p>
          He's competed at the highest amateur and pro-am levels, including the
          <strong>Valero Texas Open</strong> and the
          <strong>59th Southern California Open Championship in 2022</strong>. That tournament experience
          translates directly into the way he coaches: no fluff, no swing-of-the-month theories — just what
          holds up under pressure.
        </p>
        <p>
          Lessons are built around your game, your tendencies, and your goals. The first-time player
          breaking 100, the weekend competitor trying to beat their buddies, the high-school senior
          building a swing that holds up in front of college coaches — they all get the same approach:
          clear feedback, repeatable mechanics, and on-course strategy that actually scores.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-md">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-800">20+</dt>
          <dd class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Years playing</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-800">5</dt>
          <dd class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Years coaching</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-800">100s</dt>
          <dd class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Lessons taught</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 shadow-xl">
        <Image
          src={aboutImg}
          alt="Patrick Pockels walking the fairway in light rain, smiling, driver in hand"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          widths={[480, 720, 1000]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 500px, 100vw"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
